<title>UK: UK delivered grain trades - Apr 18.</title>
<headline>UK delivered grain trades - Apr 18.</headline>
<text>
<p>UK grain brokers reported the following delivered grain trades at 1415 gmt, in Sterling a tonne -</p>
<p>Feed wheat to Norfolk/Suffolk Apr 100.00/100.50 Jul 105.00/05.50</p>
<p>Avon range May 100.00 Jun 102.00 Jul 105.00</p>
<p>Liverpool May 103.50</p>
<p>Bedfordshire, Buckinghamshire and Northamtonshire May 99.00</p>
<p>Feed barley to Southampton Apr 105.00</p>
</text>
